"type":"text","text":"The system gives the same identifier to every app of one vendor on one device, and a new one"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"once all of them are removed. Traffluent reads it and never stores it, nor makes one up where"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the system has none: on macOS and Linux, and on a device whose system hasn’t one yet (just"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"restarted, still locked), records carry no key. It is a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Sensitive"},{"type":"text","text":" value, so a destination"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reads it only through the record it arrived in, and not at all once a delivery redacts it:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["let vendorID = record.context[VendorIdentifierKey.self].flatMap(record.reveal)  \/\/ a UUID"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"}],"kind":"content"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ServiceContext"},{"type":"text","text":" key of the platform’s identifier for vendor, which"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Enricher.vendorIdentifier()"},{"type":"text","text":" sets on every record’s context: the one identifier that outlives"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a session that Traffluent offers, and only because the operating system owns it."}],"references":{"doc://StandardContext/15Instrumentation0A10ContextKeyP":{"title":"Instrumentation.InstrumentationContextKey","type":"unresolvable","identifier":"doc:\/\/StandardContext\/15Instrumentation0A10ContextKeyP"},"doc://StandardContext/s8SendableP":{"title":"Swift.Sendable","type":"unresolvable","identifier":"doc:\/\/StandardContext\/s8SendableP"},"doc://StandardContext/documentation/StandardContext/VendorIdentifierKey/InstrumentationContextKey-Implementations":{"kind":"article","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/standardcontext\/vendoridentifierkey\/instrumentationcontextkey-